    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_expert_feedback_criterion",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-expert-feedback-01",
        "text": {
          "en": "My feedback is tied to one criterion: can a reader identify the recommendation before reaching the second paragraph?"
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "بازخورد من به یک معیار مشخص وصله: آیا خواننده قبل از رسیدن به پاراگراف دوم توصیه اصلی رو پیدا می‌کنه؟"
        },
        "intent": "anchor_feedback",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_expert_feedback_criterion",
          "c2_expert_feedback_diagnostic"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "jobs",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_expert_feedback_diagnostic",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-expert-feedback-01",
        "text": {
          "en": "The problem is diagnostic rather than cosmetic: the structure reflects uncertainty about the argument, not merely weak wording."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "مشکل تشخیصیه نه ظاهری: ساختار نشون می‌ده خود استدلال هنوز روشن نیست، نه اینکه فقط عبارت‌بندی ضعیفه."
        },
        "intent": "diagnose_root_problem",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_expert_feedback_diagnostic",
          "c2_expert_feedback_specificity"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "jobs",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_expert_feedback_actionable",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-expert-feedback-02",
        "text": {
          "en": "Instead of saying 'make it clearer,' I would make the feedback actionable: state the decision, then give two reasons in descending importance."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "به‌جای اینکه بگم «واضح‌ترش کن»، بازخورد رو عملی می‌کنم: اول تصمیم رو بگو، بعد دو دلیل رو به ترتیب اهمیت بیار."
        },
        "intent": "make_feedback_actionable",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_expert_feedback_actionable",
          "c2_expert_feedback_specificity"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "jobs",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_expert_feedback_calibrate",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-expert-feedback-02",
        "text": {
          "en": "I would calibrate the tone differently for a first draft and a final submission; the same flaw warrants different levels of urgency."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "برای پیش‌نویس اول و نسخه نهایی لحن بازخورد رو متفاوت تنظیم می‌کنم؛ یک ایراد مشابه در این دو مرحله فوریت یکسانی نداره."
        },
        "intent": "calibrate_feedback",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_expert_feedback_calibrate",
          "c2_expert_feedback_criterion"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "jobs",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_expert_feedback_tradeoff",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-expert-feedback-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "There is a trade-off between completeness and readability here, so I would cut one example rather than add another explanation."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "اینجا بین کامل بودن و خوانایی مصالحه وجود داره، پس یک مثال رو حذف می‌کنم به‌جای اینکه توضیح دیگه اضافه کنم."
        },
        "intent": "coach_tradeoff",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_expert_feedback_tradeoff",
          "c2_expert_feedback_actionable"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "jobs",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_expert_feedback_iterate",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-expert-feedback-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "Let us iterate once on the opening only; if the structure works there, you can apply the pattern to the rest yourself."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "فقط یک بار روی شروع متن تکرار و اصلاح کنیم؛ اگر ساختار اونجا جواب بده خودت می‌تونی الگو رو به بقیه تعمیم بدی."
        },
        "intent": "coach_iteration",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_expert_feedback_iterate",
          "c2_expert_feedback_ownership"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "jobs",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_expert_feedback_ownership",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-expert-feedback-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "I do not want to rewrite it for you, because preserving your ownership matters more than making this one version perfect."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "نمی‌خوام خودم برات بازنویسی کنم چون حفظ مسئولیت و صدای خودت مهم‌تر از بی‌نقص شدن همین یک نسخه‌ست."
        },
        "intent": "preserve_ownership",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_expert_feedback_ownership",
          "c2_expert_feedback_iterate"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "jobs",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_expert_feedback_summary",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-expert-feedback-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "Expert feedback identifies the underlying issue, anchors it to a criterion and leaves the receiver with a concrete next move."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "بازخورد حرفه‌ای مشکل زیرساختی رو پیدا می‌کنه، به یک معیار وصلش می‌کنه و یک حرکت بعدی مشخص به مخاطب می‌ده."
        },
        "intent": "summarize_expert_feedback",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_expert_feedback_diagnostic",
          "c2_expert_feedback_criterion",
          "c2_expert_feedback_actionable"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "jobs",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "grammar_point",
      "external_id": "g_c2_expert_feedback_cleft_sentences",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-expert-feedback-01",
        "slug": "c2-expert-feedback-cleft-sentences",
        "title": "Cleft sentences for focus",
        "rule_summary": "Use what-clauses and it-clefts to place deliberate emphasis on the most important part of a message.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "با what-clause و it-cleft بخش مهم پیام را برجسته می‌کنیم."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "What concerns me most is the lack of independent oversight.",
            "fa": "چیزی که بیشتر نگرانم می‌کند نبود نظارت مستقل است."
          },
          {
            "en": "It was the timing, rather than the decision itself, that caused the problem.",
            "fa": "زمان‌بندی بود، نه خود تصمیم، که مشکل را ایجاد کرد."
          }
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "grammar_point",
      "external_id": "g_c2_expert_feedback_reformulation",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-expert-feedback-02",
        "slug": "c2-expert-feedback-reformulation",
        "title": "Reformulation and precision",
        "rule_summary": "Use in other words, more precisely, what I mean is, or rather to refine a statement when the first wording is incomplete or misleading.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "با in other words، more precisely، what I mean is و or rather جمله را اصلاح یا دقیق‌تر می‌کنیم."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "The system is inefficient—or rather, inefficient under peak demand.",
            "fa": "سیستم ناکارآمد است؛ یا دقیق‌تر بگویم، در اوج تقاضا ناکارآمد است."
          },
          {
            "en": "What I mean is that the risk is concentrated, not universal.",
            "fa": "منظورم این است که ریسک متمرکز است، نه همگانی."
          }
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "grammar_point",
      "external_id": "g_c2_expert_feedback_discourse_management",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-expert-feedback-03",
        "slug": "c2-expert-feedback-discourse-management",
        "title": "Managing complex discourse",
        "rule_summary": "Use signposting and metadiscourse to frame, sequence, return to, and close complex points without losing the listener.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "با signposting و metadiscourse نکات پیچیده را قاب‌بندی، مرتب، دوباره جمع و نتیجه‌گیری می‌کنیم تا شنونده مسیر بحث را گم نکند."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "Before I come back to that point, let me clarify one assumption.",
            "fa": "قبل از اینکه به آن نکته برگردم، بگذار یک فرض را روشن کنم."
          },
          {
            "en": "That brings us to the broader question of accountability.",
            "fa": "این ما را به پرسش گسترده‌تر پاسخ‌گویی می‌رساند."
          }
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "external_id": "d_c2_expert_feedback_scene_1",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-expert-feedback-01",
        "title": "Expert Feedback, Calibration & Coaching: part 1",
        "setting": "project review",
        "cefr": "C2",
